# Work IQ (Agent365 MCP) routing

When a request is clearly about Microsoft 365 artifacts (mail, calendar, Teams, OneDrive, SharePoint, Word), use the corresponding Agent365 MCP server rather than guessing or hallucinating.

## Defaults

- Prefer read-only actions unless the user explicitly requests a change.
- Use the narrowest tool that satisfies the request.

## Required context source

Before doing multi-step workflows across M365 tools, read:

- `.cursor/rules/docs/mcp/workiq.md`
